  "texts": [
   "Siri sucks, so here's",
   "how you can make",
   "it 100 times better",
   "thanks to AI.",
   "This guy did exactly that.",
   "He was so frustrated",
   "with the Siri experience",
   "that was just so",
   "bad out of the box,",
   "that he took matter",
   "into his own hands",
   "and created this",
   "free GitHub repo",
   "that manages to",
   "connect his Siri",
   "to Codex, the",
   "coding assistant",
   "made by OpenAI.",
   "Now, this drastically",
   "improves his",
   "experience with Siri.",
   "Now he can communicate",
   "and actually get",
   "stuff done.",
   "This repo is 100% free,",
   "and it's also linked in the",
   "description down below",
   "if you ever need it.",
   "Now follow for more",
   "AI news, videos, and",
   "tutorials each and",
   "every single day,",
   "and catch you",
   "in the next one."
  ],
